    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: de8cedf1bda63967c948a09724e3384da757f4e4 -->\nDelta re-check of head de8cedf1 against the previous reviewed head a19370ee: clean.\n\nThe only change is `.claude/skills/review-prs/SKILL.md` step 2b (4 lines changed):\n- green (MERGEABLE) now removes `needs-rework`, `conflicts` and `needs-maintainer`;\n- orange (CONFLICTING) now removes `merge-ready` and `needs-maintainer`;\n- red (blocking) now removes `merge-ready` and `needs-maintainer`;\n- yellow (needs-maintainer) is unchanged in effect: adds `needs-maintainer`, removes `merge-ready` and `needs-rework`.\n\nEvery rule now clears `needs-maintainer` except the yellow one, as requested. No other file changed. The PR is MERGEABLE / CLEAN on re-read. Verdict: clean, merge-ready.\n",
