    "body": "<!-- review-cost: measured -->\n**Estimated agent cost:** ~$0.02 (115k tokens, measured)\n\n| Run | Model | Tokens | Est. cost |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| reviews | Haiku 5.5 | 115k | ~$0.02 |\n\nBlended upper estimate: 90 % input / 10 % output at list price (Opus 5.5 ~$5.60/M, Sonnet 5.5 ~$2.80/M, Haiku 5.5 ~$0.14/M). Cache reads make the real cost lower; main-session coordination isn't counted.\nCovers the agent runs dispatched from the maintainer's session; a contributor's own authoring cost isn't visible and isn't included.",
